## Ambient tick: small, non-lethal atmospheric events

execute as @a[gamemode=!creative,gamemode=!spectator] at @s if predicate foggy:random/5_percent run function foggy:ambient/creak
execute as @a[gamemode=!creative,gamemode=!spectator] at @s if predicate foggy:random/5_percent run function foggy:ambient/footsteps
execute as @a[gamemode=!creative,gamemode=!spectator] at @s if predicate foggy:random/5_percent run function foggy:ambient/leaves
